  "body": "Part of #308. Depends on #317 (carried body).\n\n## Today\n`rest::prior_digest` / `rest::prior_state` and `rest::ahead_of` (`crates/app/src/rest.rs`, `rest/ahead.rs`) skip operations of other setups, so a setup-2 rough re-cuts air setup 1 already removed; digests do not cross setups, so regenerating setup 1 leaves setup 2's toolpaths Ok.\n\n## Proposal\n- `prior_*` / `ahead_of` read the carried body (setup 1 through the transform) as a later setup's starting stock when that setup starts from the previous one.\n- A later setup's op digest includes the earlier setups' digests and the transform, so editing or regenerating setup 1 marks setup 2's ops **Stale** (and the post refuses stale ops, as today).\n- Suppression (PR #161): a suppressed setup-1 op that a setup-2 op was generated against is refused by name - the same law as inside one setup.\n\n## Done means\nPinned: a setup-2 adaptive rough skips the region setup 1 cleared; changing a setup-1 depth marks setup-2 ops Stale; suppressing the setup-1 rough blocks the post by name.\n",
